stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Conversation delivery - five states in each independent direction
  accDescr: The same append engine uses independent GitHub-to-Zendesk and Zendesk-to-GitHub ledgers. Pending originals may append once. Sending and uncertain work only recover through unique marked destination evidence.
  direction TB
  state "pending" as Pending
  state "sending" as Sending
  state "uncertain" as Uncertain
  state "delivered" as Delivered
  state "blocked" as Blocked

  [*] --> Pending: eligible original snapshot
  Pending --> Pending: fields / review / preflight wait
  Pending --> Sending: audit then append
  Pending --> Delivered: marked copy exists
  Pending --> Blocked: unsafe / changed / immutable
  Sending --> Delivered: unique read-back
  Sending --> Uncertain: unconfirmed outcome
  Sending --> Blocked: privacy violation
  Uncertain --> Uncertain: missing copy - never resend
  Uncertain --> Delivered: unique recovery
  Uncertain --> Blocked: privacy violation

  note right of Pending
    Key: same five states in each independent ledger.
    New appends need fresh synced fields without review.
  end note
  note right of Blocked
    Public-copy evidence holds both channels.
    No automatic reset or resend.
  end note
  note right of Delivered
    Retain destination ID; suppress copied origins.
  end note
